Sources read (upstream code was read, not run):

  zotero     https://github.com/zotero/zotero      commit 9cbba8c4d281
             chrome/content/zotero/xpcom/duplicates.js,
             chrome/content/zotero/mergeItems.mjs (Zotero.Items.merge),
             xpcom/data/items.js (merge, moveChildItems),
             xpcom/data/relations.js, xpcom/data/dataObject.js (relations),
             xpcom/data/item.js (addRelatedItem, _getRelatedItems,
