             tests test/tests/duplicatesTest.js, relationsTest.js,
             mergeItemsTest.js, dataObjectTest.js, itemTest.js
  utilities  https://github.com/zotero/utilities   commit 4051881d59c6
             utilities.js (cleanISBN, toISBN13, removeDiacritics and its
             _diacriticsRemovalMap, which upstream credits to
             http://lehelk.com/2011/05/06/script-to-remove-diacritics/),
