`src/zotero/diacritics_generated.rs` is the upstream map transcribed
mechanically. No upstream test data file is copied; the ported tests build
their fixtures in code. `src/zotero/kovan_map.rs` ports no upstream code
(it is kovan's own mapping); it also re-implements kovan's own
`classify::slugify` from `crates/kovan` (same copyright holder as this
crate), which is `pub(crate)` there.

Each ported file carries a header naming its upstream file(s) and commit.
